       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], this is amazing!\\. Surely the greatest discovery since the opening of the \\v[area.heat-dng.name]!",
       "transl": "Seeker, das ist unglaublich!\\. Das ist mit Abstand die größte Entdeckung seit der Freilegung des Faj'ro-Tempels!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...?",
       "transl": "...?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ANNOYED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, it might not look like much.\\. In fact it gives an impression of being a dead-end.",
       "transl": "Ja, es mag nicht nach viel aussehen.\\. Tatsächlich vermittelt es einem den Eindruck, es sei eine Sackgasse."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But you see...\\. these devices...",
       "transl": "Aber...\\. diese Geräte..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "... and the nature of the sand...\\. it all hints to a hidden way into a deep sanctuary of Ancient nature.",
       "transl": "... und die Beschaffenheit des Sandes...\\. Alles deutet auf einen Geheimgang zu einer uralten heiligen Stätte der Ahnen hin."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ASTONISHED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, it is so very exciting!\\. Now sadly...",
       "transl": "Ja, das ist so aufregend!\\. Nur leider..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...?",
       "transl": "...?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "... the mechanism seems to be unusable to us right now.",
       "transl": "... erschließt sich mir der Mechanismus momentan noch nicht."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "To find a way inside, we will need to examine this place and properly integrate it into Trackwalker.",
       "transl": "Um einen Weg hineinzufinden, müssen wir den Ort hier weiter untersuchen und ihn sauber ins Pfadläufersystem integrieren."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, this will take some time to finish.\\. But we have already made great progress today.\\. Amazing job, \\v[lore.title.seeker]!",
       "transl": "Ja, es wird eine Weile dauern.\\. Aber wir sind heute gut vorangekommen.\\. Gute Arbeit, Seeker!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "PROUD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "You can now return to HQ and leave this to us.\\. Send my regards to the leader, yes?",
       "transl": "Du kannst jetzt ins Hauptquartier zurück und den Rest uns überlassen.\\. Grüß mir den Chef, ja?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "nomads.female-shorthair-bluetunic",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
